# care-notes Beta Onboarding Checklist

## Beta Guardrails

- Product: care-notes.com beta only
- Slack home: #rennxai-carenotes
- Revenue separation: keep care-notes beta activity separate from CRM revenue and lead tracking
- Beta target: 3-5 families live and paying
- Beta pricing: $15-20/month per participating family
- First named beta families: Carol, Wick, then new families as added

